ile Agent app demo","target":"sg-agent-demo","line":59}],"metadata":{"title":"Mobile Agent app","description":"Use the ServiceNow Mobile Agent app to update records, coordinate with coworkers, track your location, and work without an internet connection — all from your mobile device. Download the Mobile Agent app for either Apple iOS from the Apple App Store or the Google Android version from the Google Play store.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/mobile/mobile-experience.html","release":"australia","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":1,"breadcrumb":["Exploring the Mobile Platform","Mobile Platform"],"tags":["#mobile","#now-mobile","#apps","#platform","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/mobile/mobile-experience.md"},
